  "HDFS-16888": {
    "jira_id": "HDFS-16888",
    "issue_type": "Improvement",
    "resolution": "Fixed",
    "title": "BlockManager#maxReplicationStreams, replicationStreamsHardLimit, blocksReplWorkMultiplier and PendingReconstructionBlocks#timeout should be volatile",
    "description": "BlockManager#maxReplicationStreams, replicationStreamsHardLimit, blocksReplWorkMultiplier and PendingReconstructionBlocks#timeout these variables may be  writen by NameNode#reconfReplicationParameters then while read by the other threads. \r\nThus they should be declared as volatile to make sure the \"happens-before\" consistency.",
